<title>BRAZIL: Brazil's Acesita Q3 net rises.</title>
<headline>Brazil's Acesita Q3 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian steel maker Acesita said it had a 16.7 million real net profit in the third quarter of 1996, reducing the company's losses so far this year to 13.1 million reais.</p>
<p>In the same period last year, the company reported a net profit of 16.4 million reais.</p>
<p>The figures, Acesita said, were adjusted for inflation.</p>
<p>Gross sales totalled $503 million, a drop of 18 percent when compared with the same period of 1995.</p>
<p>-- Fatima Cristina, Sao Paulo Newsroom, 5511-2324411</p>
</text>
